cloud-init: resource "warm_cache" [unsupported-runtime-condition]: resource carries runtimeWhen "ansible_facts['os_family'] == 'Debian'", which this target cannot express: cloud-init applies user-data as written and has no per-resource condition to compile it into. Put the test inside an exec resource's command if only a command depends on it (hint: use a compile-time `when`, or remove the condition; see the capability matrix)
